    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyū Yelemia akang'winha Selaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nelia ng'wana Maaseya, ūyo walī ntūmami ntaale wa hikūlū. Lyalī ikanaza īlo akaja Babuloni hamò na Sedekia ntemi wa Yuda mu ng'waka gwa kanè go būtemi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelemia walī wīyandīka mu shitabo pyī ī mihayo ya mayanga ayo gaalī gizile kwīgwīīla ī Babuloni; pyī īyo yalī yamala kwandīkwa kūlwa Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akang'wīla ū Selaya, “Ūlū ūlashike ī Babuloni ūkūbasomela pyī ī mihayo yenīyī n'ilaka lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlīmalīja hayaga gīkī, ‘Ee SEEBA, bebe ng'wenekīlī wahaya ūkūlīkenaagūla ī lipandī lyenīlī, atizikala mo munhū nūūlū ndimu, lībize buyīkī ilalī.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūlū ūshikalīcha ū kūshisoma ī shitabo shenīshi, shitungīlījage iwe, ūshiluute mu mongo gwa Fulati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūkūhaya gīkī, ‘Nī Babuloni īkūlibīla gīkī, ītūbūūka hangī kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji būtaale ūbo nakwīyenhela. A banhū ba ng'wene nabo bakūgwishiwa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo yang'wa Yelemia yashilīla henaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
